.Nm openssl-crl
.Nd CRL command
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm openssl
.Ar crl
.Oo
.Fl help ]
.Oo
.Fl inform
.Ar DER Ns | Ns Ar PEM ]
.Oo
.Fl outform
.Ar DER Ns | Ns Ar PEM ]
.Oo
